+    /// @notice The 64-bit-lane `u ‖ v` of a packed ciphertext (`u` words at memory `up`, `v` words at `vp`) written at
+    ///         memory `dst` (ascending; each coefficient is an `mstore` of 32 bytes, so 24 bytes past `dst + CT` are
+    ///         clobbered: callers write what follows afterwards).
+    function unpackTo(uint256 dst, uint256 up, uint256 vp) internal pure {
